PROPOSAL (not applied) -- repo chmoses98/nfl-edge-finder, branch main. Two files must change together, otherwise the slot gate
(scripts/ops/pit_availability_health.py::scheduled_slots) treats an unlisted cron time as already covered and skips it.
Hours below are copied from the kickoff-derived planner hours in sift-alpha nfl-prospective-ops.yml (Thanksgiving Thu 11-26,
Fri 11-27, Sat 12-05/12/26, Sat 12-19, Fri 12-25); the owner must verify them against the official 2026 schedule before applying.
